---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /
description: Open hardware built one board at a time — ambient sensors, macropads and the firmware that drives them. Schematics, specifications and how to commission a piece.
---
{% from "partials/piece-tile.njk" import tile %}

<section class="band band--brand">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="label label--on-dark" style="display: block; margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">Hardware in progress</span>
    <h1 class="display" style="color: var(--white);">Hardware, built one piece at a time.</h1>
    <p class="lede on-dark-body" style="margin-top: var(--space-6);">
      Sensors, macropads and the boards underneath them, designed on one bench. Every piece here is measured,
      documented, and open — schematics and firmware included.
    </p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a class="btn btn--invert" href="/work/">See the work</a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost btn--on-dark" href="/order/">Order a piece</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<hr class="rule">
<section class="wrap band">
  <div class="section-head">
    <span class="label">01 — selected work</span>
    <h2 class="h1">What is on the bench.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="piece-grid">
    {%- for piece in collections.featured %}
    {{ tile(piece) }}
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
  <div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn--secondary" href="/work/">All work</a></div>
</section>

<hr class="rule rule--hair">
<section class="wrap band">
  <div class="section-head">
    <span class="label">02 — the bench</span>
    <h2 class="h1">One maker, no team, no product line.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      hw.i.p is one person and one bench. PCB layout in KiCad, firmware, and the assembly in between. Nothing
      here is mass produced and nothing is designed to be — each board is built for a specific job, measured,
      and written down.
    </p>
    <p>
      The process, including the parts that fail, goes on Instagram. This page is what survived it.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="btn-row">
    {%- for s in site.socials %}
    <a class="btn btn--secondary" href="{{ s.href }}" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">{{ s.handle }}</a>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<hr class="rule">
<section class="band band--invert">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="label label--on-dark" style="display: block; margin-bottom: var(--space-3);">03 — order</span>
    <h2 class="h1" style="color: var(--white);">Commissions are open.</h2>
    <p class="lede on-dark-body" style="margin-top: var(--space-4);">
      One piece at a time, built to a brief. Send the dimensions and what it has to do — I will tell you
      whether I can build it before either of us commits to anything.
    </p>
    <div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn--invert" href="/order/">Start an enquiry</a></div>
  </div>
</section>
